  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.AWSOASIS v2.0.5\n\nConnects the OASIS to Amazon DynamoDB through AWSSDK.DynamoDBv2 for holon and avatar persistence. The same SDK path supports AWS-hosted DynamoDB and DynamoDB Local for repeatable integration evidence. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- docs(providers): refresh Oracle recovery evidence and correct AWS history readiness (b3d58a2)\n- feat(aws): add session credentials and explicit SDK credential-chain mode (2d6fd02)\n- fix: protect scoped AWS graphs and advertise cloud capabilities (c38f0d1)\n- fix(aws): require native save acknowledgements and persist detail keys (de3583e)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Organize HyperDrive provider working reports under dedicated WIP folder (b699b48)\n- test(aws): refresh full local storage interface verification (6daa314)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Cloud/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.AWSOASIS",
